  "raw_html": "<button type='button' role='link' class='btn btn-link p-0 text-start' id='link_17' aria-label=\" Pandurang Vithal Kevne versus Bharat Sanchar Nigam Limited & Anr. pdf\"  class='noToken' href='#' onclick=javascript:open_pdf('17','2024','2024_12_2113_2122','2024INSC1051'); ><font size='4'> <strong>PANDURANG VITHAL KEVNE<span class='fst-italic'> versus </span>BHARAT SANCHAR NIGAM LIMITED & ANR. </strong>- <span class='escrText'>[2024] 12 S.C.R. 2113</span><span class='ncDisplay'>2024 INSC 1051</span><input type='hidden' id='cnr' value=ESCR010007972024></button></font><br><strong>Coram : J.K. MAHESHWARI<sup style=\"color: #268e97;font-size: 22px;top: 0;\" class=\"tooltip-sup\" data-tooltip=\"Author\">*</sup>, RAJESH BINDAL</strong><br> Issue for Consideration Whether the High Court rightly disallowed Petitioner&rsquo;s application for condonation of delay and rejected the second review petition in light of Petitioner&rsquo;s repeated and frivolous litigation. Headnotes&dagger; Condemnation of unscrupulous from one forum to another despite the issue being well-settled through reasoned orders &ndash; A stark example of blatant misuse and abuse of the judicial process &ndash; Forum shopping by filing repetitive and meritless pleas in Supreme Court and High Court &ndash; Repetitive and meritless pleas<br><strong class='caseDetailsTD' ><span style='color:#212F3D' > Decision Date :</span><font color='green'> 19-12-2024</font><span style='color:#212F3D' > | Case No :</span><font color='green'>  No. 56230/2024</font>   <span style='color:#212F3D' > |  Bench :</span><font color='green'>  Judges</font></strong><div class='row my-1 mt-2 border bg-light'><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('17','2024','2024_12_2113_2122','2024INSC1051','S')><i <i class='fas fa-columns me-2'></i>Split view</a></div><div class='col-auto'><a href='#' class='btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm my-1' onclick=open_splitview('1